M2 fallback training produced `models/best.pt`; see LOGBOOK 2026-06-24 M2 training entry and `models/README.md` for the artifact, training command, per-class mAP, and known caveats.

M1 hardware verification (camera topic + ML/runtime versions on the Jetson) is already complete and recorded in the 2026-06-23 M1 LOGBOOK entry. The M1 camera-topic verification did NOT check the depth topic; M4c1 added the live probe of `/depth_cam/depth/image_raw` (~30.5 Hz, 640×360 16UC1 mm) and confirmed `/depth_cam/depth_registered/points` does NOT exist on this install.

